  description: 'The standard challenge.


    - 10 rounds

    - Carbon drift +0.8/round

    -
    Balanced starting stats (C:50 E:50 S:50)

    - 10 starting capital, +1 per round

    -
    Standard thresholds (crisis at C>85, E<15, S<15)

    - Tipping point at 90 avg
    carbon

    - Chain collapse at 3+ crisis regions

    - 50% positive spillover
    to neighbors

    - Rewards after 2+ carbon drop

    - Standard skip penalties

    -
    20% focus event chance'
